# After the story: the post-credits at 00:25 (docs/DESIGN.md §3.5, chapter 5) and v1's ending gag.
# post.credits plays after the credits roll (main.roll_credits), with Mme Dupont locking up behind Mano on rue
# Pasteur: v1's lines word for word where they fit (the AirPods back in, *plink*, "Where is my OTHER one."), and
# Mme Dupont's two recorded lines from v1's ending, so both keep their voice files: "M scratch, chewed stem...
# gross. Yes, that one is yours." (unused in chapter 2 because of its twist) and "Not my problem, sweetie.". Then
# the recap.
# post.v1_ending is v1's ending as it was (the AirPod back from the lost & found): no chapter plays it, because
# of the chapter 2 twist; autotest=ending plays it on its own (Story.ending()).

# 00:25, rue Pasteur, Mano alone heading for the last metro; Mme Dupont locking up behind him
~ post.credits
think: 00:25. Last metro at {{word.last_metro}}. Rue Pasteur, all mine.
think: "Keep it charged," Toma said. Both in. Stereo, all the way home. [if given_to == "toma"]
think: "Not chewed any more," Anisha said. It is still chewed. [if given_to == "anisha"]
think: Ian gave it back "for political reasons". [if given_to == "ian"]
think: Silvia gave it back. "Same AirPod. Two ears. Like the pastry." [if given_to == "silvia"]
think: Ishita gave it back. She kept the memory, as promised. [if given_to == "ishita"]
think: Cristina gave it back. Second handover of the night. This one worked. [if given_to == "cristina"]
think: Joaquin gave it back with a note: "one song, four minutes, data noted." [if given_to == "joaquin"]
mano: [#grin] Okay. Music time. Left one in...
$ airpods ear
mano: ...right one in...
$ drop_airpod grate
nar: *plink*
mano: ...
mano: [#shock] Wait.
think: A drain. Right under my foot. The only drain on rue Pasteur.
mano: [#shock] Where is my OTHER one.
think: Mme Dupont, locking up. She leans over the grate.
madame: [#annoyed] M scratch, chewed stem... gross. Yes, that one is yours.
madame: [#smirk] *sips coffee* Not my problem, sweetie.
$ set credits_done
$ recap

~ post.v1_ending
madame: [#annoyed] M scratch, chewed stem... gross. Yes, that one is yours.
$ sfx fanfare
$ give_airpod
$ banner "Stereo restored" "two ears. finally."
$ toast "My AirPod!" airpod
mano: [#grin] FINALLY. Two ears. Stereo. Life is good again.
madame: *sips coffee* Wonderful. Now leave.
mano: Okay. Music time. Left one in...
mano: ...right one in...
$ drop_airpod
nar: *plink*
mano: ...
mano: [#shock] Wait.
mano: [#shock] Where is my OTHER one.
madame: [#smirk] *sips coffee* Not my problem, sweetie.
$ ending
